# Line endings.
#
# `.editorconfig` already asks for LF, but git was left on its own defaults
# (`core.autocrlf=true` on the Windows checkout writes CRLF back on every
# checkout, while oxfmt writes LF). The two fought each other: each `pnpm run
# fmt` left dozens of files that `git status` called modified while `git diff`
# showed nothing at all. `eol=lf` pins the bytes on disk to the bytes the
# formatter writes, and `text=auto` keeps the repository blobs normalised.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: excluded from the text filters above so they are never
# normalised, diffed as text, or merged line-wise.
*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
*.vsix binary